\hline
Hard   & Non-agentic & 66 & 0.288 & 0.513 & 0.712 & 0.970 & 1.000 \\
       & Agentic     & 66 & \textbf{0.182} & \textbf{0.616} & \textbf{0.818} & \textbf{0.985} & 1.000 \\
